      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Storage (Event Log): ~3,300 writes/sec × 86,400 seconds = ~285 Million writes/day. At ~20 bytes per event = ~5.7 GB/day.",
